{"id":"5033","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5033_main_cumulus-congestus-pileus-flammagenitus_clouds-lithometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这张照片是从加拿大不列颠哥伦比亚省温哥华市南部拍摄的，其中显示了因野火升温而产生的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">火成性积云</span>。云的顶部显示出强烈的萌芽及清晰的轮廓，表明这是浓云云种。此外，上升的热量穿透了升高的潮湿空气层，产生了<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">伞状</span>附属云。西南低层风导致野火<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">烟雾</span>羽流向东北方向漂移，从观测的角度遮蔽了积云的底部。天空在很大程度上是晴朗的，只有若干<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">淡积云</span>。</p>\n<p>随附的延时视频显示了这张照片中各种特征的发展。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Irene Ho","location":"加拿大温哥华","latitude":"纬度: 49° 16' 58'' N","longitude":"经度: 123° 7' 15'' W","date":"03 July 2016 1508 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.9.16","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.9.16"},{"src":"/images/movie_play_blue.png","title":"","description":"","copyright":"","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":"","videoSrc":"/images/compressed/tlvid/5033_tlvid_cumulus-congestus-pileus-flammagenitus_clouds-lithometeors.mp4"}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4654_main_cumulus-congestus-flammagenitus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>这张照片拍摄于葡萄牙的Serra de Alvorge，照片中显示的是由于野火升温而产生的浓积云。因此，被归类为火成性浓积云。</p>\n<p>西北向的低空微风使得<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">野火的烟雾慢慢向东南方漂移</span>， <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">一些烟雾也垂直升入</span>低层大气层。然而，大气压在大约2300米以上非常不稳定，而对流烟羽迅速上升到相当高的高度，导致形成一个 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">火成性浓积云</span>云塔。</p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Jan Knight","location":"葡萄牙Serra de Alvorge","latitude":"纬度: 39° 59' 5'' N","longitude":"经度: 8° 27' 58'' W","date":"18 September 2012 1635 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.9.16","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.9.16"},{"src":"/images/compressed/4834_main_cumulus-congestus-flammagenitus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>在这张照片高于底层烟雾的上方可以看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">火成性浓积云</span>。云的形成是因<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">野火</span>上方空气对流的直接结果。</p>\n<p>位于塞浦路斯利马索尔区Potamissa附近的野火，距离拍摄照片的Kivides村约有20公里。由于<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">烟雾直接从火中升起</span>和在低层大气中散布的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">一层烟雾</span>使得部分云底被遮挡住。在图片的右侧，其他自然来源的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积云</span>也被烟雾部分隐藏。</p>\n<p>由于范围相对较大，其膨胀的上部与<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">花椰菜</span>类似，而且<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">从云顶突出的云塔</span>，火成性积云被确定为浓云云种。随着时间的推移的观测结果表明，这些云塔仅从云的主体升起，在上面的干燥大气中消散。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© George Anderson","location":"塞浦路斯Kivides","latitude":"纬度: 34° 45' 41'' N","longitude":"经度: 32° 50' 41'' E","date":"06 August 2007 1708 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东北","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.9.16 4","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.9.16 4"}]}]}